{{#if subject}}
{{{inviterName}}} invited you to Foxden
{{/if}}
{{#if text}}
You're invited to sync Firefox with Foxden

{{{inviterName}}} invited you to create an account on {{{serverHost}}}, the Foxden server they run.

Foxden keeps your bookmarks, history, passwords and open tabs in sync across your devices, stored on their server instead of Mozilla's.
{{#if admin}}

You'll join as an admin, so you'll also be able to invite people and manage accounts.
{{/if}}

Accept the invite by opening this link in Firefox:

{{{link}}}

The link works once and expires on {{dateTime expiresAt}}. After you choose a password, we'll show you how to connect Firefox.

If you weren't expecting this invite, you can ignore this email. No account is created until you accept.
{{/if}}
{{#if html}}
{{#> layout}}
  {{#*inline "footer"}}
    If you weren't expecting this invite, you can ignore this email. No account is created until you accept.
  {{/inline}}

  <h1>You're invited to sync Firefox with Foxden</h1>

  <p>
    {{inviterName}} invited you to create an account on <span class="strong">{{serverHost}}</span>, the Foxden server
    they run.
  </p>

  <p>
    Foxden keeps your bookmarks, history, passwords and open tabs in sync across your devices, stored on their server
    instead of Mozilla's.
  </p>

  {{#if admin}}
  <p>You'll join as an admin, so you'll also be able to invite people and manage accounts.</p>
  {{/if}}

  <table role="presentation" class="button" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
    <tr>
      <td><a href="{{link}}">Accept Invite</a></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p class="note" style="margin: 24px 0 6px">Or paste this link into Firefox:</p>

  <div class="inset"><a href="{{link}}">{{link}}</a></div>

  <div class="divider">&nbsp;</div>

  <p class="note" style="margin: 0">
    The link works once and expires on {{dateTime expiresAt}}. After you choose a password, we'll show you how to connect
    Firefox.
  </p>
{{/layout}}
{{/if}}
